    "nudge": "The First Conversion — A known metahuman is broken by the BCP and reappears as an animal-themed villain serving Clarity. — Any roster hero may replace Aurelia as the first conversion. Record adaptedFrom/adaptedTo and keep the converted character's relationships.",
    "once": true
  },
  {
