          "title": "Crystal Cat Hunts Colorgarde — Deadline",
          "summary": "Mira captures an ally instead, and Claire gains leverage over Colorgarde."
        }
      }
    ],
    "nudge": "Crystal Cat Hunts Colorgarde — Mira Shard, Claire's crystal clone, is deployed specifically to neutralize Colorgarde's light powers and humiliate her in public. — The function is a tailored counter to the protagonist. If Mira is gone, Claire builds or hires a different counter.",
    "once": true
  },
  {
