      {
        "chronicle": {
          "category": "event",
          "title": "The Confrontation with Claire — Deadline",
          "summary": "Claire completes her endgame uncontested; the season moves to villain victory unless a later beat intervenes."
        }
      }
    ],
    "nudge": "The Confrontation with Claire — Colorgarde and Claire Atropos finally face each other with the fate of the city on the line. — The confrontation can happen anywhere Claire's plans converge. Substitutes may take Claire's place only if she is already defeated; then this beat short-circuits.",
    "once": true
  },
  {
    "id": "s1.resolution.clarity-falls",
