          "summary": "The final deadline passes: Claire wins completely, and the season ends in a recorded villain victory."
        }
      }
    ],
    "nudge": "Clarity Incorporated Falls — Claire is defeated and Clarity's control breaks — through capture, conversion, death, or a public collapse of the corporation. — Claire may be brainwashed into Claire Lachesis, imprisoned, killed, or forced into exile. Any terminal or converted state resolves the beat; record the divergence.",
    "once": true
  },
